    "image_with_text_XA9Fxt": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "t:sections.image--image-with-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/1-2_a4cdf3a1-668c-496b-82bb-5fb80db610a3.jpg",
        "layout": "left",
        "title": "Inclusivity and Diversity",
        "text": "<p>At SilverAnt, we foster an inclusive and diverse global community that reflects the values and principles of our brand. We know that a diverse team brings new perspectives, ideas, and creativity to our products and helps us to better serve our customers.</p><p>We are committed to creating a welcoming environment for individuals of all backgrounds to work and thrive in. We value and celebrate the unique differences that make each of us who we are. SilverAnt believes that our multicultural perspective helps us to create better products and foster a more inclusive outdoor community.</p><p>Our team is made up of people from all over the world, and we actively seek to attract and retain talent from diverse backgrounds. We do not discriminate based on race, ethnicity, gender, sexual orientation, religion, age, or any other characteristic. We believe that everyone should have the opportunity to contribute and grow within our company.</p>",
        "text_alignment": "left",
