    "image_with_text_DnYzeJ": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "t:sections.image--image-with-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/1-3_3f9cdeb8-d778-480d-a1b5-2e31aef07b1a.jpg",
        "layout": "right",
        "title": "Partnerships",
        "text": "<p><em>“If you want to go fast, go alone; if you want to go far, go together”.</em></p><p><em>African Proverb</em></p><p>At SilverAnt, we believe in making a tangible impact on the world around us. That's why we're proud to partner with like-minded content creators, organizations, and advocates who share our passion for the outdoors.</p><p>Through our partnerships, we work towards greater access to nature and support underserved communities. SilverAnt supports organizations, individuals, and experts in their field to make a positive impact on the environment and society.</p><p>Our partnerships go beyond financial contributions and product donations. We use our outdoor business to showcase authentic stories of our partners' work and amplify their message. We believe that by working together, we can make a meaningful difference in the world.</p><p>Some of our recent and ongoing partners include the <a href=\"https://www.mainechildrenshome.org/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.mainechildrenshome.org/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Maine Children's Home</span></a> for their Outdoor Recreation program. As well as the <a href=\"https://www.hotdoghike.com/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.hotdoghike.com/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Hot Dog Hike</span></a> for homelessness.</p><p>As SilverAnt grows, we look forward to continuing to work with our partners and creating a larger impact.</p>",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_overlapping_image": false,
        "button_link": "",
        "button_label": "",
        "buttons_style": "filled",
        "override_button_colors": false,
        "button_background_color": "#e68819",
