    "image_with_text_tCywaz": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "name": "t:sections.image--image-with-text.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/1-4.jpg",
        "layout": "left",
        "title": "Sustainability at SilverAnt",
        "text": "<p>At SilverAnt, we are committed to reducing our impact on the environment and promoting sustainability in every aspect of our business. We believe that it is our responsibility to protect the planet and its resources for future generations.</p><p>To work towards being a responsible business, we have now partnered with <a href=\"https://public.getgreenspark.com/1687637516787/silverant-outdoors/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://public.getgreenspark.com/1687637516787/silverant-outdoors/\">Greenspark</a>. For every order you place, we offset the impact by planting trees, capturing carbon, and rescuing plastic bottles from the ocean.</p><p>As a company, we are implementing strategies and partnering with organisations that help us reduce our Carbon Footprint as well as certifying and validating our commitment to sustainability. This, in turn, showcases our commitment to environmentally friendly practices.</p><p>Sustainability is an ongoing journey, and there's always room for improvement. By addressing various aspects of our business, from sourcing materials to end-of-life management, we can continue to enhance SilverAnt's positive impact on the environment while delivering quality products to you, our customers!</p>",
        "text_alignment": "left",
        "text_overlapping_image": false,
        "button_link": "",
        "button_label": "",
        "buttons_style": "filled",
        "override_button_colors": false,
