        "layout": "right",
        "title": "Product Sustainability",
        "text": "<p>As a company, we strive to create products that are built to last a lifetime. This means fewer products end up in landfills. </p><p>All SilverAnt's products are made with titanium, which is built to endure the toughest outdoor conditions. Nevertheless, we are also acutely aware that titanium is a precious metal, and for extraction, it is mined. With this knowledge at our own manufacturing facility, we recycle all possible waste. We also make sure that our products are repairable, so you can fix them instead of replacing them.</p><p>For our packaging, we work with eco-friendly packaging materials that can be easily recycled or are biodegradable.</p><p><em>Lastly, we offer a lifetime guarantee for our titanium products.</em></p>",
        "text_alignment": "left",
